{"id":"wb-6-343","name":"永年城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"广府城","text":"广府城，又称永年城，是位于中国河北省邯郸市永年区的一座古城，也是明清广平府府治、永年县县治（1958年前）所在地。城址位于永年区东南60公里处的永年洼中，永年洼面积28平方公里，而古县城坐落于延伸至湖中的半岛上。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B9%BF%E5%BA%9C%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":85512251,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85512251","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/03479395f1e02ef0a6ea47f7.jpg","title":"行摄梓地_hiroko.cn_MRG_6203.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A1%8C%E6%91%84%E6%A2%93%E5%9C%B0_hiroko.cn_MRG_6203.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/%E8%A1%8C%E6%91%84%E6%A2%93%E5%9C%B0_hiroko.cn_MRG_6203.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"梓地","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​广平府西门和护城河","width":320,"height":479}}